NV_PK(13,{"here is the front hall up close two stone lions guard the steps and dragons wrap around the stone columns behind them look through the open door and you can see deep into the temple":"","in the main hall a dragon is carved winding up this dark column look at the column behind it can you find a crane":"","this green guardian beside mazu points far away he is thousand mile eye legend says he can see a thousand miles so he spots people in danger at sea on the right is a small shrine to the water immortal kings gods who protect people at sea":"","in the middle of the main hall sits mazu with a gold face with many small statues in front of her look up old plaques hang all around one came from the kangxi emperor and another from the qianlong emperor":"","this shrine is for guanyin the buddhist goddess of mercy the big old plaque above her is dated 1821 a lantern hides part of it":"","three buddhas sit under the red banner with a smiling round bellied buddha in front two tall guardian gods stand on both sides to protect them":"","behind the iron gate is the shrine of yue lao the matchmaker god he shares it with the earth god he is one of tainan's four famous matchmakers":"","next to yue lao heart shaped cards cover the wall people hang a card here to make a wish for love when the wish comes true they come back and hang a card to say thank you":""});